1
00:00:00,148 --> 00:00:01,938
(Sheldon:)...whose work has brought him
to the precipice...

2
00:00:02,108 --> 00:00:06,158
(Sheldon:)...of forever changing mankind's
understanding of the universe, a.k.a. me.

3
00:00:07,656 --> 00:00:11,576
(Sheldon:)And here, we have a waitress
brushing her teeth with her finger.

4
00:00:12,911 --> 00:00:14,791
(Sheldon:)A.k.a. you.

5
00:00:15,247 --> 00:00:17,457
(Leonard:)Sorry.
Is this supposed to be buttering me up?

6
00:00:17,624 --> 00:00:20,584
(Sheldon:)Please hold all questions
until the end of the presentation.

7
00:00:20,752 --> 00:00:24,462
(Sheldon:)This is the Large Hadron Collider
at CERN in Switzerland.

8
00:00:24,631 --> 00:00:27,591
(Sheldon:)The product of decades
of planning and construction.

9
00:00:27,759 --> 00:00:30,469
(Sheldon:)It is a mecca
for physicists the world over.

10
00:00:31,096 --> 00:00:35,096
(Sheldon:)This is Bath and Body Works
on Colorado Boulevard.

11
00:00:35,267 --> 00:00:39,107
(Sheldon:)They sell scented soaps and lotions.
Some of which contain glitter.

12
00:00:39,271 --> 00:00:42,441
(Sheldon:)Now, let's see
if we can match the individual...

13
00:00:42,607 --> 00:00:44,437
(Sheldon:)...to the appropriate destination.

14
00:00:44,985 --> 00:00:46,985
(Penny:)Okay. Show's over.

15
00:00:47,153 --> 00:00:49,613
(Sheldon:)No, it's not. I've got five more slides.

16
00:00:50,156 --> 00:00:51,946
(Penny:)Sheldon, this is Leonard's decision.

17
00:00:52,117 --> 00:00:58,027
(Penny:)He invited me to Switzerland
and I intend to go.

